The registry-first sample tests/registry/lt.jsonl contains addresses, postcodes and coordinates
from the Address Register of the Republic of Lithuania (Adresų registras), kept by the State
Enterprise Centre of Registers (VĮ Registrų centras), as published in its raw data ("Adresų
registro pirminiai duomenys"): addresses of land plots and buildings (adr_stat_lr.csv), address
points (adr_gra_adresai_LT.zip, data formed on 2026-10-01), streets, settlements, municipalities
and counties, downloaded on 2026-10-29. Source: VĮ Registrų centras, Adresų registras, 2026-10-01
(https://www.registrucentras.lt/atviri-duomenys-ir-statistika/adresu-registro-pirminiai-duomenys-raw-data).
Used under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Changes: the files were joined by their codes (tests/registry/adr-csv.sql) and a sample drawn;
queries were constructed from the register's fields, not by Registrų centras. Per-case file
checksums and retrieval dates are recorded in the corpus; docs/evaluation/registry/lt.md records
the upstream checksums.
